  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="《論語》">
      <data key="d0">《論語》</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">《論語》 is a collection of sayings and ideas attributed to Confucius, often studied alongside《孝經》 in understanding Confucian philosophy.&lt;SEP&gt;《論語》是孔子的哲學思想記載的書籍，地位隨著時期變遷逐漸提升。&lt;SEP&gt;《論語》是孔子的言論集結，將其教育思想和哲學理念傳承下來。&lt;SEP&gt;《論語》 is another classic text based on the thoughts of Confucius, serving as a major source of Confucian teachings.&lt;SEP&gt;《論語》是儒家經典之一，經過朱熹的詮釋，在宋代的經學地位提升，成為考試的依據。&lt;SEP&gt;《論語》是孔子及其弟子言行的記錄，在儒學中具有基礎性和經典地位。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f34dff0945453a5b68182bad891123d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aaf763df3817bf1c61a76282875c415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b09c1beeb6cdaac1d5c6fe2cd99821c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7673fc9b62772651fef821560eab0454&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="《孟子》">
      <data key="d0">《孟子》</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">《孟子》 is a classic text of Confucian philosophy that includes discussions on ethics, politics, and morality attributed to the philosopher Mencius.&lt;SEP&gt;《孟子》是對孔子思想的發展與延續，深入探討了仁義及政治倫理。&lt;SEP&gt;《孟子》闡述了性善論，是儒家繼孔子後的重要思想著作，其地位在歷史中不斷被推崇。&lt;SEP&gt;《孟子》是儒家經典之一，與其他經典一同提高其學術地位，影響深遠。&lt;SEP&gt;《孟子》是儒家重要經典，強調仁義，並在宋代重新被詮釋和重視。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f34dff0945453a5b68182bad891123d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aaf763df3817bf1c61a76282875c415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7673fc9b62772651fef821560eab0454</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="孔子">
      <data key="d0">孔子</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Confucius is a prominent ancient Chinese philosopher whose teachings and discussions are compiled in 《論語》, emphasizing personal ethics, social-political philosophy, and education.&lt;SEP&gt;孔子, also known as Confucius, is a central figure in Chinese philosophy, revered as the founder of Confucianism. His philosophical teachings profoundly influenced Chinese history and culture. He is traditionally considered the author or key influencer of several classical texts, including the《孝經》, the《論語》, and is associated with the compilation of the《尚書》. 

孔子 played a significant role in providing interpretations for the《周易》 through his work known as the 'Ten Wings', enhancing its philosophical depth. He is also recognized for his contributions to the Spring and Autumn Annals, which influenced the principles of 公羊學, a school of thought that expanded upon his ideas. Furthermore, he is reported to have organized the six classics and contributed original content, thereby establishing the foundations of classical studies.

As a renowned philosopher and educator during the pre-Qin period, 孔子 sought to convey his values and historical criticisms through his writings, particularly in light of societal decline. His teachings and philosophies formed the bedrock of Confucian thought, influencing generations long after his time. His legacy endures through the various classical texts attributed to him and the enduring relevance of his philosophies in contemporary discussions of ethics and governance.&lt;SEP&gt;孔子, or Confucius, is a Chinese philosopher whose thoughts greatly influenced Chinese education, morals, and philosophy.&lt;SEP&gt;孔子是中國古代著名的思想家，他對《詩經》的編纂和學術研究提出了重要見解，並主張詩歌表達志向。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f88c28d67c43225bd395c7b72883c6d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-456acc88bff5107c7463714dcad1fa3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b09c1beeb6cdaac1d5c6fe2cd99821c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2052f122203d0c467d6ec2d975457a07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b7f7d84f75209241c4251820f0a1d67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c04c5d6dada2047dbc9841f81a6bb483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a3a4f57fc3782e37551e40c2452317e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79e0519e059bd1b7719df554b4821058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76fef02a7da482530991d3fe525c8458&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0e0beed827cb3372537ec3ec3233f33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8e859b9cfaecbe4f6dadf116534874f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7d7f02159c40bb08446bc82ad81f3fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-978067c90c25f4531e0fa80e8d050213&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7673fc9b62772651fef821560eab0454&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80ad40565e835fecb6dc58653b22f14d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92017ddc5be08415581cd644da759130</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="漢朝">
      <data key="d0">漢朝</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The Han Dynasty is a significant era in Chinese history when《孝經》 gained recognition as a canonical text in Confucian literature.&lt;SEP&gt;漢朝是中國歷史上的一個重要朝代，在該時期《論語》和《孟子》的地位逐漸被提升。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b09c1beeb6cdaac1d5c6fe2cd99821c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7673fc9b62772651fef821560eab0454</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="唐朝">
      <data key="d0">唐朝</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">唐朝是一個統一經學的時期，進一步促進了經學的發展和統一。&lt;SEP&gt;唐朝是中國歷史上的一個重要朝代，以其多元文化和繁榮的經濟著稱。&lt;SEP&gt;唐朝是中國歷史上的一個重要朝代，以其文化繁榮和政治制度著稱，杜佑生活並創作於此時期。&lt;SEP&gt;唐朝是中國歷史上的另一重要朝代，期間《論語》已納入經部，而《孟子》的地位也在提升。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-facf47454dbfc68c690fe82947c34445&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7673fc9b62772651fef821560eab0454&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6732829a589fba1949a07505004e4bb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="宋朝">
      <data key="d0">宋朝</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">宋朝包括北宋和南宋，是《孟子》最終被正式納入經典的重要歷史時期。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7673fc9b62772651fef821560eab0454</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="四書">
      <data key="d0">四書</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《四書》 consists of four key Confucian texts that are foundational in Chinese philosophy and education, which includes teachings from《禮記》.&lt;SEP&gt;四書是儒家經典的重要文獻，包括《論語》和《孟子》，由元代納入科舉考試，地位上升。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7673fc9b62772651fef821560eab0454&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-635e67efc992a86fd06fbda104e7d526</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="五經">
      <data key="d0">五經</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">五經是中國儒家經典的重要組成部分，《論語》和《孟子》後來被視為平起平坐的經典。&lt;SEP&gt;五經是由六經演變而來的經典集合，最終定義為《詩經》、《書經》、《禮經》、《易經》和《春秋》，代表了重要的儒家經文。&lt;SEP&gt;五經是儒家經典的核心文本，包括《周易》、《尚書》、《毛詩》、《禮記》和《春秋》，是經學研究的基礎。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-facf47454dbfc68c690fe82947c34445&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7673fc9b62772651fef821560eab0454&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="王允">
      <data key="d0">王允</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">王允是東漢時期的學者，曾將《孟子》列為傳的教材，予以重視。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7673fc9b62772651fef821560eab0454</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="韓愈">
      <data key="d0">韓愈</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">韓愈是唐朝的文學家，他提倡《孟子》，提升了其在社會中的地位。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7673fc9b62772651fef821560eab0454</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="楊棺">
      <data key="d0">楊棺</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">楊棺是唐朝的官吏，他向朝廷建議將《論語》、《孝經》和《孟子》合為一經。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7673fc9b62772651fef821560eab0454</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="王安石">
      <data key="d0">王安石</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">王安石 is a historical figure and influential scholar known for integrating political thoughts into classical literary interpretations during the Song Dynasty.&lt;SEP&gt;王安石 is a historical figure and scholar whose works combined political insights with classical interpretations during the Song Dynasty.&lt;SEP&gt;王安石是北宋的政治家，他於北宋時期提議兼治《論語》和《孟子》。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7673fc9b62772651fef821560eab0454&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef97655b62e53bb7a60e0e3dc48c01c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="十二經">
      <data key="d0">十二經</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">十二經 refers to the Twelve Classics of Confucian literature, among which 《爾雅》 was included, underscoring its significance.&lt;SEP&gt;十二經是唐代國子監刻印的經典書籍，當時並不包括《孟子》。&lt;SEP&gt;十二經是唐代增刪經典的結果，其中包含《爾雅》，以及經典之中重要著作，如《論語》和《孟子》的獨立列出。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7673fc9b62772651fef821560eab0454&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76fef02a7da482530991d3fe525c8458</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="十三經">
      <data key="d0">十三經</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">十三經包括了儒家的經典著作，其中在南宋正式納入了《孟子》。&lt;SEP&gt;十三經是在宋代接受了新經典的定義，其中《孟子》被正式納入，並且經典總數最終確立為十三部。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7673fc9b62772651fef821560eab0454&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="六經">
      <data key="d0">六經</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">六經包括《詩經》、《尚書》、《禮經》、《樂經》、《易經》和《春秋經》，是先秦時期重要的經典教材。&lt;SEP&gt;六經是中國古代經典書籍的集合，包括《詩經》、《易經》、《書經》、《禮經》、《樂經》及《春秋》，對儒學及其發展具有重要意義。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80ad40565e835fecb6dc58653b22f14d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="十經">
      <data key="d0">十經</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">十經是對五經的擴展，包括《公羊傳》、《穀梁傳》和其他分拆的經典，顯示儒學範疇的進一步擴張。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="《詩經》">
      <data key="d0">《詩經》</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">《詩經》是中國最古老的詩集之一，成為儒家核心經典之一。&lt;SEP&gt;《詩經》是先秦時期的重要經典，具有賦詩和隱詩的傳統，士大夫在交際中經常引用。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80ad40565e835fecb6dc58653b22f14d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="《易經》">
      <data key="d0">《易經》</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">《易經》是一部占卜書籍，通常帶有告誡的意味，影響先秦時期的思想和信仰。&lt;SEP&gt;《易經》是中國古代的經典，主要研究變化與哲理，對未來的預測和決策有重要影響。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80ad40565e835fecb6dc58653b22f14d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="《書經》">
      <data key="d0">《書經》</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">《書經》是中國古代的一部重要典籍，主要記錄周朝等歷史事件與哲學思想。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="《禮經》">
      <data key="d0">《禮經》</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">《禮經》講述周代的禮儀制度及倫理思想，是儒家文化中的一部分。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="六藝">
      <data key="d0">六藝</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">六藝是指六經所涵蓋的學術領域，包括文學、歷史、哲學、音樂、藝術與社會倫理等。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="《春秋》">
      <data key="d0">《春秋》</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">《春秋》 is a historical text authored by 孔子 that serves as the foundation of 公羊學's theories and political ideals.&lt;SEP&gt;《春秋》 is a historical text composed by 孔子 that documents the Chronological records of the State of Lu, serving as the basis for 公羊學.&lt;SEP&gt;《春秋》是中國春秋時期的歷史記錄，反映了社會及政治事件，是儒家重要的經典之一。&lt;SEP&gt;《春秋》是中國古代歷史書籍，詳細記載了春秋時期的事件。&lt;SEP&gt;《春秋》是中國古代的一部歷史書籍，記錄了春秋時期的事件，對後世歷史編纂有影響。&lt;SEP&gt;《春秋》是古代中國的另一部重要文獻，孔子以其為基礎，並於《左傳》中進行解釋。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c6732829a589fba1949a07505004e4bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-456acc88bff5107c7463714dcad1fa3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92017ddc5be08415581cd644da759130</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="《公羊傳》">
      <data key="d0">《公羊傳》</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">《公羊傳》是《春秋》的一部解釋文獻，對事件進行了深刻的分析和詮釋。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="《穀梁傳》">
      <data key="d0">《穀梁傳》</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《穀梁傳》 is a classical Chinese text that discusses interpretations of ancient texts, particularly focused on historical and literary analysis in the context of Confucian studies.&lt;SEP&gt;《穀梁傳》是另一部對《春秋》的解釋文獻，增進了對歷史事件的理解。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2839ff734b09e4d4e24ef4e67c33e63f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="《禮記》">
      <data key="d0">《禮記》</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Book of Rites is an ancient Chinese text that includes references to《論語》 and is important for understanding Confucian rituals and ethics.&lt;SEP&gt;《禮記》 elaborates on the core meanings of rites, providing commentary that supplements《儀禮》.&lt;SEP&gt;《禮記》是描述周代禮儀及社會行為規範的一部經典，強調了倫理與道德的重要性。&lt;SEP&gt;《禮記》 is another key text in Confucianism that discusses important rituals and ethical behavior, relevant in the context of《孝經》.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b09c1beeb6cdaac1d5c6fe2cd99821c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b7f7d84f75209241c4251820f0a1d67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce572fe16ea7d30395652864474cba03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8e859b9cfaecbe4f6dadf116534874f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="《儀禮》">
      <data key="d0">《儀禮》</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">《儀禮》 is a classical text that discusses the principles and practices of ancient rituals in Chinese culture.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4b7f7d84f75209241c4251820f0a1d67</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="三禮學">
      <data key="d0">三禮學</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">三禮學 is a scholarly framework encompassing three key texts:《儀禮》,《禮記》, and《周禮》, focusing on the study of rites.&lt;SEP&gt;三禮學是包含《周禮》、《儀禮》和《禮記》的經學體系。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4b7f7d84f75209241c4251820f0a1d67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be527ec0ce99fb40e90ea163df1654a3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="《周禮》">
      <data key="d0">《周禮》</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《周禮》 records the Zhou Dynasty's official system and ancient customs, serving as a significant companion text to《儀禮》.&lt;SEP&gt;《周禮》是中國古代的一部經典，杜佑在創作中受到其影響，構成了政治和社會的理論基礎。&lt;SEP&gt;《周禮》是中國古代的一部重要典籍，對《通典》的撰寫具有影響。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c6732829a589fba1949a07505004e4bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b7f7d84f75209241c4251820f0a1d67</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="鄭玄">
      <data key="d0">鄭玄</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">鄭玄 is a prominent figure in Chinese scholarship known for his commentaries on《儀禮》 and related texts during the Han Dynasty.&lt;SEP&gt;鄭玄 is a prominent historical scholar who played a crucial role in the debates over the textual legitimacy of ancient works and their interpretation.&lt;SEP&gt;鄭玄 is a scholar known for his contributions to the debate between the old and new textual traditions, notably unifying versions of ancient texts.&lt;SEP&gt;鄭玄是一位東漢著名學者，參與《左傳》與其它經典的辯論，是今古文之爭的重要人物。&lt;SEP&gt;鄭玄是東漢著名學者，他對今古文之爭進行融合，幫助平息學術爭端。&lt;SEP&gt;鄭玄是東漢的儒學家，他的學說在魏晉時期重新取得優勢，與王肅的學業對抗。&lt;SEP&gt;鄭玄 was an influential scholar during the Han dynasty known for his commentary and textual analysis of classical texts.&lt;SEP&gt;鄭玄是東漢著名的學者，他對《詩經》進行了註釋，增進了詩經的學術價值。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2052f122203d0c467d6ec2d975457a07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b7f7d84f75209241c4251820f0a1d67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c04c5d6dada2047dbc9841f81a6bb483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37d058d7db25f00d83d1f8e8f3b1fcda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef97655b62e53bb7a60e0e3dc48c01c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0e0beed827cb3372537ec3ec3233f33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92017ddc5be08415581cd644da759130</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="《禮古經》">
      <data key="d0">《禮古經》</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">《禮古經》 is an ancient script featuring a collection of rites, discovered in Kongbi, with insights beneficial for understanding《儀禮》.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4b7f7d84f75209241c4251820f0a1d67</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="清代">
      <data key="d0">清代</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">清代 was a historical period in China that influenced the study and interpretation of ancient rites including《儀禮》.&lt;SEP&gt;清代是中國歷史最後一個封建王朝，該時期對《春秋左氏傳》的研究進一步深化。&lt;SEP&gt;清代 was a period marked by a resurgence in the study and interpretation of classical texts, including extensive commentaries on《禮記》.&lt;SEP&gt;清代 was a period of increased scholarly work and research on《禮記》, producing significant literature and interpretations.&lt;SEP&gt;清代, or the Qing dynasty, marked a revival in classical literature and the collection of contemporary writings.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2052f122203d0c467d6ec2d975457a07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b7f7d84f75209241c4251820f0a1d67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92017ddc5be08415581cd644da759130&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-635e67efc992a86fd06fbda104e7d526</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="民國">
      <data key="d0">民國</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">民國 refers to the Republic of China period, during which there were significant efforts to restore the study of《儀禮》.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4b7f7d84f75209241c4251820f0a1d67</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="士冠禮">
      <data key="d0">士冠禮</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">士冠禮 is one of the rituals documented in《儀禮》 that pertains to the coming of age ceremony for scholars.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4b7f7d84f75209241c4251820f0a1d67</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="有司徹">
      <data key="d0">有司徹</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">有司徹 is a ritual detailed in《儀禮》 that refers to the ceremonial retirement of officials.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4b7f7d84f75209241c4251820f0a1d67</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="公羊學">
      <data key="d0">公羊學</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">公羊學 is a school of thought in Confucianism that emphasizes interpretation of the 'Book of Documents' and has had a significant influence on traditional Chinese thought.&lt;SEP&gt;公羊學 is a significant school of thought during the Han dynasty focusing on historical and political interpretations of the Spring and Autumn Annals.&lt;SEP&gt;公羊學 is a significant school of thought during the Han dynasty that emphasizes the philosophical and political interpretations of the Spring and Autumn Annals.&lt;SEP&gt;公羊學是以孔子的《春秋》為基礎的學說，強調陰陽五行理論，影響漢代的經學發展。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-456acc88bff5107c7463714dcad1fa3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a569eebcf602b73488d7aec6e7fc183&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37d058d7db25f00d83d1f8e8f3b1fcda</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="三科九旨">
      <data key="d0">三科九旨</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">三科九旨 refers to the core theoretical framework of 言學, including three categories and nine principles that analyze the content and political implications of the Spring and Autumn Annals.&lt;SEP&gt;三科九旨 refers to the core theories of 公羊學 that analyze the content and philosophical implications of the Spring and Autumn Annals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-456acc88bff5107c7463714dcad1fa3d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="周朝">
      <data key="d0">周朝</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The Zhou Dynasty is critical in the history of《周易》 for its further development and codification of divination systems associated with the text.&lt;SEP&gt;The Zhou Dynasty is significant in the history of《周易》 for its expansion and development of the divination system.&lt;SEP&gt;周朝 is the ruling dynasty discussed in the context of the new dynasties that emerged and its influence on the political thoughts explored in 公羊學.&lt;SEP&gt;周朝 was an ancient Chinese dynasty discussed in the context of its role and influence in newer dynasties addressed by 公羊學.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-456acc88bff5107c7463714dcad1fa3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79e0519e059bd1b7719df554b4821058</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="商朝">
      <data key="d0">商朝</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The Shang Dynasty is an ancient Chinese dynasty that may have significantly influenced divination practices and the development of《周易》。&lt;SEP&gt;The Shang Dynasty is an ancient Chinese dynasty, which may have contributed to the development of divination methods used in《周易》.&lt;SEP&gt;商朝 refers to the dynasty whose legacy is inherited by 宋國 and discussed within the 三科九旨 framework.&lt;SEP&gt;商朝 refers to the earlier dynasty whose traditions are referenced within the 三科九旨 framework.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-456acc88bff5107c7463714dcad1fa3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79e0519e059bd1b7719df554b4821058</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="魯國">
      <data key="d0">魯國</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">魯國 is the state that孔子 was most associated with, and its historical events are analyzed within the Spring and Autumn Annals.&lt;SEP&gt;魯國 is the state with which 孔子 had a close relationship and is frequently referenced within the Spring and Autumn Annals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-456acc88bff5107c7463714dcad1fa3d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="宋國">
      <data key="d0">宋國</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">宋國 is known as the successor to 商朝, which plays a critical role in the historical and ritual contexts explored by 公羊學.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-456acc88bff5107c7463714dcad1fa3d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="恩義">
      <data key="d0">恩義</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">恩義 refers to the moral and ethical implications present within孔子's teachings, highlighting societal values and governance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-456acc88bff5107c7463714dcad1fa3d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="撥亂反治">
      <data key="d0">撥亂反治</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">撥亂反治 is a concept articulated by孔子 through the teachings in《春秋》，indicating the restoration of order from chaos.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-456acc88bff5107c7463714dcad1fa3d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
