    <node id="鄭樵">
      <data key="d0">鄭樵</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">鄭樵 (Zheng Qiao) was a Chinese scholar and historian known for his extensive work in categorizing and analyzing historical texts and cultural practices through various categories in his writings.&lt;SEP&gt;鄭樵 is a Chinese scholar known for his contributions to historical literature and categorization of knowledge, particularly through his work that includes various categories such as geography and literature.&lt;SEP&gt;鄭樵 is an influential figure known for his innovative historical research methods and his work which impacts historiography.&lt;SEP&gt;鄭樵是中國歷史學家，著有《通志》，該書涵蓋廣泛，增補了未被記載的歷史材料。&lt;SEP&gt;鄭樵是宋代著名的歷史學家與文獻學者，他撰寫了《通志》，並因其對歷史的考證與分類而受到尊重。&lt;SEP&gt;鄭樵是宋代學者，對《公羊傳》進行批評，探討其解經方法的有效性。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c1defc13d866f264ae8e228e97ca24b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09238a689ae6310d69bc9b4c26093b8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41d60f49b80f79dc8e2ce29d36c2536a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-978067c90c25f4531e0fa80e8d050213&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b46e4c69b61255f3ee05e2dcba596c99</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="通志">
      <data key="d0">通志</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">《通志》是鄭樵撰寫的一部歷史著作，旨在整理唐、宋以前的歷史，以通史的形態呈現。&lt;SEP&gt;《通志》是鄭樵的著作，作為一部文化史的通典，提供了宏觀的歷史視野。&lt;SEP&gt;通志 is a significant historical work authored by 鄭樵, compiling various categories of knowledge to preserve Chinese history and culture.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41d60f49b80f79dc8e2ce29d36c2536a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1defc13d866f264ae8e228e97ca24b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b46e4c69b61255f3ee05e2dcba596c99</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="馬端臨">
      <data key="d0">馬端臨</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">馬端臨 is an author and scholar from the Song dynasty, known for his extensive academic contributions and the compilation of《文獻通考》.&lt;SEP&gt;馬端臨是一位歷史學家，著有《文獻通考》，重視文本的收集和考訂，以及參考資料和批評。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-09238a689ae6310d69bc9b4c26093b8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41d60f49b80f79dc8e2ce29d36c2536a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="文獻通考">
      <data key="d0">文獻通考</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">《文獻通考》 is a significant historical work compiled by 馬端臨 that aims to provide comprehensive insights into historical texts and institutional systems.&lt;SEP&gt;《文獻通考》是馬端臨的著作，主要收錄宋代史書未收錄的材料，並補充了制度的缺漏。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-09238a689ae6310d69bc9b4c26093b8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41d60f49b80f79dc8e2ce29d36c2536a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
