    <node id="周易">
      <data key="d0">周易</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《周易》是中國古代的卜筮之書，後來被視為哲學經典，對魏晉玄學和宋明理學有深遠的影響。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f302770a88f96e8338a79a7003fd9376</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="孔穎達">
      <data key="d0">孔穎達</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">孔穎達 was a prominent scholar during the Tang dynasty who compiled the《禮記正義》, referencing earlier interpretations to enhance the understanding of《禮記》。&lt;SEP&gt;孔穎達 was a respected Tang dynasty scholar who compiled the《禮記正義》, aiming to clarify and interpret the contents of《禮記》.&lt;SEP&gt;孔穎達 was a scholar known for his commentary on the Book of Documents, highlighting its significance in Confucian studies.&lt;SEP&gt;孔穎達是著名的學者，以其對《周易》的註釋《周易正義》而知名。&lt;SEP&gt;孔穎達 was a scholar responsible for the commentary《春秋左傳正義》, providing crucial insights into《春秋》 and《左傳》.&lt;SEP&gt;孔穎達 was a scholar responsible for the commentary《春秋左傳正義》, providing insights into《左傳》.&lt;SEP&gt;孔穎達是唐代的學者，負責編寫《五經正義》，這是政府修訂的經書注疏。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-facf47454dbfc68c690fe82947c34445&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ef97655b62e53bb7a60e0e3dc48c01c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67c3f6706d7d4d4989bd1cc0998fcf9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f302770a88f96e8338a79a7003fd9376&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-635e67efc992a86fd06fbda104e7d526</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="高亨">
      <data key="d0">高亨</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">高亨是一位學者，撰寫了《周易古經今注》，對《周易》進行了深入的研究。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f302770a88f96e8338a79a7003fd9376</data>
