    <node id="王弼">
      <data key="d0">王弼</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">王弼同樣是魏晉學者，透過融合儒家與道家的義理，進一步推動經學的玄理化。&lt;SEP&gt;王弼是一位古代哲學家，他的著作《周易二種》對於《周易》的理解和傳承起到了重要作用。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c04c5d6dada2047dbc9841f81a6bb483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f302770a88f96e8338a79a7003fd9376</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="朱熹">
      <data key="d0">朱熹</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Zhu Xi is an influential philosopher in Neo-Confucianism who wrote commentary on《論語》，helping to shape its interpretation in later centuries.&lt;SEP&gt;朱熹 was a Song dynasty philosopher who extracted parts of《禮記》 into the《四書》, significantly contributing to the text’s importance in examination protocols.&lt;SEP&gt;朱熹 was a prominent Confucian scholar whose interpretations contributed to the understanding of《春秋》 and its coherence.&lt;SEP&gt;朱熹 was a prominent Confucian scholar whose interpretations contributed to the understanding of《春秋》 and《左傳》.'&lt;SEP&gt;朱熹是宋代學者，批評《公羊傳》過度細究褒貶，影響了後世對其解讀的看法。&lt;SEP&gt;朱熹是著名的儒學家，他的《四書章句集注》對儒家思想的傳播起到了重要作用。&lt;SEP&gt;朱熹是著名的理學家，與王弼共同撰寫《周易二種》為《周易》提供了新的解釋。&lt;SEP&gt;朱熹 was a prominent Song dynasty philosopher who incorporated《禮記》 into the《四書》, thus enhancing its role in Confucian education.&lt;SEP&gt;朱熹是宋代的哲學家、理學家，他的學說強調道德修養和經典的解釋，並對後來的儒學發展有深遠影響。&lt;SEP&gt;朱熹是宋代著名的理學家，他推動經典的詮釋，強調道德修養和心性的學習，對後世影響深遠。&lt;SEP&gt;朱熹 was a prominent Confucian scholar of the Song dynasty, known for his contributions to the study of the Book of Songs.&lt;SEP&gt;朱熹是中國著名的儒家學者，對《詩經》進行了深入的評論和詮釋，在其學術發展中扮演重要角色。&lt;SEP&gt;朱熹是中国宋代的著名理学家和教育家，以其对四书的注释和解读而闻名。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f88c28d67c43225bd395c7b72883c6d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2052f122203d0c467d6ec2d975457a07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f34dff0945453a5b68182bad891123d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67c3f6706d7d4d4989bd1cc0998fcf9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9477146f79d070b064f7a1631189c102&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0e0beed827cb3372537ec3ec3233f33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8e859b9cfaecbe4f6dadf116534874f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-978067c90c25f4531e0fa80e8d050213&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f302770a88f96e8338a79a7003fd9376&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-635e67efc992a86fd06fbda104e7d526</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
