      <data key="d2">清末 refers to the late Qing Dynasty period in Chinese history, during which substantial political and intellectual developments occurred, influencing the study of 公羊學.&lt;SEP&gt;清末是中國歷史上的一個時期，此時對《周禮》的研究和評價也有爭議。</data>
