      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">周公 (Duke of Zhou) is traditionally attributed as one of the possible authors of 《爾雅》, associated with ancient Chinese scholarly works.&lt;SEP&gt;周公是《周禮》內容中的關鍵人物，被認為是《周禮》的編纂者之一。</data>
