      <data key="d0">離婁</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">離婁 is another figure included in《孟子》, representing discussions on moral and philosophical principles.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5aaf763df3817bf1c61a76282875c415</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="告子">
      <data key="d0">告子</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">告子 is recognized in《孟子》 as a figure whose interactions and debates with Mencius help illustrate Confucian thought.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5aaf763df3817bf1c61a76282875c415</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="論語">
      <data key="d0">論語</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《論語》 is a collection of sayings and ideas attributed to the Chinese philosopher Confucius and his disciples, serving as a foundational text of Confucian philosophy.&lt;SEP&gt;《論語》是對孔子及其弟子言論的記錄，描述了儒家思想和倫理觀念。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f88c28d67c43225bd395c7b72883c6d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8e859b9cfaecbe4f6dadf116534874f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="孟子弟子">
      <data key="d0">孟子弟子</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">孟子弟子是在孟子指導下學習的門徒，透過問答學習儒家思想。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f88c28d67c43225bd395c7b72883c6d2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="焦循">
      <data key="d0">焦循</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">焦循是研究《孟子》的學者，注釋並解釋了其文本。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f88c28d67c43225bd395c7b72883c6d2</data>
