    <node id="宋翔鳳">
      <data key="d0">宋翔鳳</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">宋翔鳳是編撰《孟子趙注補正》的學者，對《孟子》的理解有深入貢獻。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f88c28d67c43225bd395c7b72883c6d2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="戴震">
      <data key="d0">戴震</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">戴震是乾嘉时期皖派的代表，注重实事求是和考证研究。&lt;SEP&gt;戴震是注釋《孟子》的學者，他的作品對於字義解釋非常重要。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f88c28d67c43225bd395c7b72883c6d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c805437a423c850850d6c3a34ad8c95f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="孫奭">
      <data key="d0">孫奭</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">孫奭是《孟子注疏》的作者，負責將《孟子》進行詳細注釋。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f88c28d67c43225bd395c7b72883c6d2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="趙順孫">
      <data key="d0">趙順孫</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">趙順孫是負責編撰《四書纂疏》的學者，對《四書》的理解和詮釋有重要貢獻。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f88c28d67c43225bd395c7b72883c6d2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="四書章句集注">
      <data key="d0">四書章句集注</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《四書章句集注》是对四书的一部详细注释，帮助读者理解儒家经典的深层含义。&lt;SEP&gt;《四書章句集注》是朱熹對《論語》、《孟子》及其他四書的集大成注釋和解釋。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9477146f79d070b064f7a1631189c102&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f88c28d67c43225bd395c7b72883c6d2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="四書纂疏">
      <data key="d0">四書纂疏</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《四書纂疏》是對四書的綜合性注疏，整合了多位學者的見解。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f88c28d67c43225bd395c7b72883c6d2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="精彩書目">
      <data key="d0">精彩書目</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f88c28d67c43225bd395c7b72883c6d2</data>
      <data key="d2">朱熹的作品和其他相關書目一起，提升了對四書的學習和研究。</data>
      <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="尚書">
      <data key="d0">尚書</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《尚書》是上古歷史與政府公文文獻的彙編，記載了從堯舜至春秋時期秦穆公的歷史和政治思想，是重要的治國理政參考。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d7d7f02159c40bb08446bc82ad81f3fe</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="今文尚書">
      <data key="d0">今文尚書</data>
      <data key="d1">version</data>
      <data key="d2">今文尚書是以漢代隸書寫成的版本，易於閱讀，包含傳承的二十九篇。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d7d7f02159c40bb08446bc82ad81f3fe</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="古文尚書">
      <data key="d0">古文尚書</data>
      <data key="d1">version</data>
      <data key="d2">古文尚書是以先秦文字寫成的版本，相對較難解讀，包含多種不同傳本。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d7d7f02159c40bb08446bc82ad81f3fe</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="春秋">
      <data key="d0">春秋</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《春秋》 is a classical Chinese text that serves as a historical chronicle and is central to the study of Chinese history and philosophy.&lt;SEP&gt;春秋是中國歷史的一個時期，這段時期的歷史和政治思想在《尚書》中有詳細記載。&lt;SEP&gt;《春秋》是中国古代历史书籍，汇集了春秋时期的重大事件，具有重要的历史价值。&lt;SEP&gt;《春秋》是孔子所作的书籍，属于经学的重要作品，对后世影响深远。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1a3a4f57fc3782e37551e40c2452317e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82160efbd04b8ce80895c11cfa021fec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7d7f02159c40bb08446bc82ad81f3fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67c3f6706d7d4d4989bd1cc0998fcf9c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="歷代治國理政">
      <data key="d0">歷代治國理政</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">歷代治國理政是《尚書》記載的主要內容，提供了古代的政治與道德理念。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d7d7f02159c40bb08446bc82ad81f3fe</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="魏晉子學">
      <data key="d0">魏晉子學</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">魏晉子學 is a category relating to the study and interpretation of classical texts from the Wei and Jin dynasties, focusing on political insights and textual authenticity.&lt;SEP&gt;魏晉子學 refers to a school of thought during the Wei and Jin dynasties that examines classical texts and their interpretations, significantly influencing political studies.&lt;SEP&gt;魏晉子學是後世對於《尚書》及其內容的學術研究與思考，對政治研究亦具影響。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3ef97655b62e53bb7a60e0e3dc48c01c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7d7f02159c40bb08446bc82ad81f3fe</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="堯舜">
      <data key="d0">堯舜</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">堯舜是中國古代傳說中的帝王，被認為是賢明的統治者，其治理理念在《尚書》中有所體現。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d7d7f02159c40bb08446bc82ad81f3fe</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="秦穆公">
      <data key="d0">秦穆公</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">秦穆公是春秋時期的統治者，他的事跡及政治想法在《尚書》中被記載。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d7d7f02159c40bb08446bc82ad81f3fe</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="偽《古文尚書》">
      <data key="d0">偽《古文尚書》</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">偽《古文尚書》 is a category of scholarly work that discusses the value and controversy surrounding pseudo manuscripts of ancient texts and their impact on politics and history.&lt;SEP&gt;偽《古文尚書》 refers to a category of scholarly work that discusses pseudo manuscripts of ancient texts and their scholarly value in Chinese literature.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3ef97655b62e53bb7a60e0e3dc48c01c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="蘇軾">
      <data key="d0">蘇軾</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">蘇軾 is a renowned figure in Chinese literature and politics whose writings reflect an integration of political views and the classical text study.&lt;SEP&gt;蘇軾 is a renowned poet and statesman whose works reflect a synthesis of political philosophy and literary form during the Song Dynasty.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3ef97655b62e53bb7a60e0e3dc48c01c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="清代尚書學">
      <data key="d0">清代尚書學</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">清代尚書學 pertains to the study of the Book of Documents during the Qing Dynasty, emphasizing textual criticism and scholarly examination.&lt;SEP&gt;清代尚書學 refers to the academic study of the Book of Documents during the Qing Dynasty, emphasizing criticism and contextual analysis of texts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3ef97655b62e53bb7a60e0e3dc48c01c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="考據學">
      <data key="d0">考據學</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">考據學 is a branch of study focused on textual criticism and authentication of ancient manuscripts, which gained prominence in the Qing Dynasty.&lt;SEP&gt;考據學 is a field of textual criticism focused on the verification of ancient texts, gaining prominence during the Qing Dynasty.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3ef97655b62e53bb7a60e0e3dc48c01c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="尚書正義">
      <data key="d0">尚書正義</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">尚書正義 is a significant scholarly commentary on the Book of Documents authored by 孔穎達, establishing authoritative interpretations of the text.&lt;SEP&gt;尚書正義 is an influential commentary on the Book of Documents, authored by 孔穎達, that plays a crucial role in the interpretation of the text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3ef97655b62e53bb7a60e0e3dc48c01c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="書經集傳">
      <data key="d0">書經集傳</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
