    <node id="公羊傳">
      <data key="d0">公羊傳</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《公羊傳》是另一部同样讲述春秋经义的文献，以其微言大义的阐释而受到关注，与《穀梁傳》形成对比。&lt;SEP&gt;《公羊傳》是解釋《春秋》的重要文獻之一，提供了該作品的義例和可參考的註釋。&lt;SEP&gt;公羊傳 is a significant work that serves as an exegetical text and embodies Confucian political ideals and historical philosophy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7a569eebcf602b73488d7aec6e7fc183&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82160efbd04b8ce80895c11cfa021fec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92017ddc5be08415581cd644da759130</data>
