      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The bamboo slip version of《論語》 discovered in 1973 is one of the oldest existing versions of the text, highlighting its historical importance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b8e859b9cfaecbe4f6dadf116534874f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="劉寶楠">
      <data key="d0">劉寶楠</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">劉寶楠是清代的注释家，他在《論語正義》中提供了对论语的详细解释。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9477146f79d070b064f7a1631189c102</data>
